_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen a column has a comment associated to it with a special character (newline, in my case), a modification is incorrectly detected where the special character (`\\n`) is escaped (`\\\\n`).\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nNo modification should be detected and the migration script should not contain the alter_column instruction.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nMigrate from\r\n```mysql\r\nCREATE TABLE `FOO` (\r\n  `BAR` timestamp COMMENT 'This is a comment line\\nThis is another comment line'\r\n);\r\n```\r\nto\r\n```mysql\r\nCREATE TABLE `FOO` (\r\n  `BAR` timestamp COMMENT 'This is a comment line\\nThis is another comment line',\r\n  `NEW_BAR` timestamp\r\n);\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Ubuntu 22.04\r\n - Python: 3.7\r\n - Alembic: 1.10.2\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 2.0.8\r\n - Database: MariaDB/MySQL 5.7.12\r\n\r\n**Have a nice day!**","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin